From: Koral Ilgun <koral.ilgun@smartrg.com>
Date: Thu, 01 Oct 2026 12:25:23 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] net: dsa: mxl862xx: apply the CPU port EVLAN to IGMP traffic

In tag_8021q mode, the ingress Extended VLAN block of the CPU port
CTP reassigns each frame from the host to the virtual bridge port of
its user port. The CTP keeps a separate Extended VLAN assignment for
IGMP traffic, and the driver set only the one for non-IGMP traffic.
IGMP frames from the host therefore stayed on the CPU bridge port.
Its port map is empty in tag_8021q mode, so the switch dropped them:
the queries of a multicast querier on the host did not reach the
LAN, and the memberships of the LAN hosts expired.

Assign the same block to IGMP traffic, because the reassignment rules
match only the management VID.
---
 drivers/net/dsa/mxl862xx/mxl862xx.c |   11 ++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/drivers/net/dsa/mxl862xx/mxl862xx.c
+++ b/drivers/net/dsa/mxl862xx/mxl862xx.c
@@ -641,6 +641,12 @@ static void mxl862xx_tag_8021q_disable_c
  * pipeline evaluates Bridge Port EVLAN first, then CTP EVLAN; the
  * bridge port reassignment treatment used by tag_8021q only works
  * reliably from the CTP level.
+ *
+ * The CTP keeps a separate EVLAN assignment for IGMP traffic. Without
+ * it, IGMP from the host skips the reassignment and stays on the CPU
+ * bridge port, whose port map is empty in tag_8021q mode, so the
+ * switch drops it. The reassignment rules match only the management
+ * VID, so the same block serves both kinds of traffic.
  */
 static int mxl862xx_set_cpu_ctp_ingress_evlan(struct dsa_switch *ds, int cpu)
 {
@@ -649,9 +655,12 @@ static int mxl862xx_set_cpu_ctp_ingress_
 	struct mxl862xx_ctp_port_config ctp = {};
 
 	ctp.logical_port_id = cpu;
-	ctp.mask = cpu_to_le32(MXL862XX_CTP_PORT_CONFIG_MASK_INGRESS_VLAN);
+	ctp.mask = cpu_to_le32(MXL862XX_CTP_PORT_CONFIG_MASK_INGRESS_VLAN |
+			       MXL862XX_CTP_PORT_CONFIG_MASK_INGRESS_VLAN_IGMP);
 	ctp.ingress_extended_vlan_enable = blk->in_use;
 	ctp.ingress_extended_vlan_block_id = cpu_to_le16(blk->block_id);
+	ctp.ingress_extended_vlan_igmp_enable = blk->in_use;
+	ctp.ingress_extended_vlan_block_id_igmp = cpu_to_le16(blk->block_id);
 
 	return MXL862XX_API_WRITE(priv, MXL862XX_CTP_PORTCONFIGSET, ctp);
 }
